      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like im running on a treadmill that's going way too fast and i can't even see the finish line anymore. every single cent i make just goes right back out to rent and debt and interest. it's like i'm working just to pay for the right to keep working. i'm just so tired of the math not adding up.",
