    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's nothing to change. that's the point. any \"small change\" just results in the same math. i work 50 hours, i pay the landlord, i pay the credit card, i eat, i sleep, i repeat. it doesn't matter how much i \"manage\" it, the numbers always end at zero. it's not a problem to be solved, it's just how the system works. how am i supposed to find hope in a calculation that's rigged to fail?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
