      "content": "When the system feels rigged, it's understandable to feel hopeless about individual changes. Sometimes, the only way out of a rigged calculation is to change the variables entirely, which means changing your relationship with the system itself. Consider what it would take to reduce the inputs—like taking a break, or finding a way to temporarily lower your required output.",
